\n===================================================================\n--- /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-kalepail-Desktop-kalepail-skills/fd5aae97-76bc-4bb3-8597-af0fa91bb3f0/scratchpad/probe-runs/glm-max__bugfix__r2__1791297374/work/ledger/money.py\n+++ /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-kalepail-Desktop-kalepail-skills/fd5aae97-76bc-4bb3-8597-af0fa91bb3f0/scratchpad/probe-runs/glm-max__bugfix__r2__1791297374/work/ledger/money.py\n@@ -17,5 +17,6 @@\n \n def format_cents(cents):\n     \"\"\"Format integer cents as '$1,234.56'. Negative values look like '-$0.05'.\"\"\"\n     sign = \"-\" if cents < 0 else \"\"\n+    cents = abs(cents)\n     return f\"{sign}${cents // 100:,}.{cents % 100:02d}\"\n","additions":1,"deletions":0},"truncated":false},"title":"private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-kalepail-Desktop-kalepail-skills/fd5aae97-76bc-4bb3-8597-af0fa91bb3f0/scratchpad/probe-runs/glm-max__bugfix__r2__1791297374/work/ledger/money.py","time":{"start":1791297450454,"end":1791297450465}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I've identified three root-cause bugs:\n\n1. **`parse_date`** (parse.py:9): returns `(y, d, m)` — month and day swapped. Docstring: (year, month, day).\n\n2. **`format_cents`** (money.py:21): floor division and modulo on negative cents produce garbage (`-310` → `-$-4.90`). Need `abs()`.\n\n3. **`top_items`** (report.py:23): sorts ascending by total (smallest first) and no tie-break by name. Docstring: descending total, ties by item name ascending.\n\nFix all three.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_111a5f1cc001Ga9d9hDo92kZ5s","sessionID":"ses_eee5b33e6ffeZG9tbgjq5aQyDr","messageID":"msg_111a5b89a001BRnrUwLWfvHZqa"}}
