{"type":"text","timestamp":1791297484445,"sessionID":"ses_eee5b33e6ffeZG9tbgjq5aQyDr","part":{"id":"prt_111a6766e0012HYWdNg1OVs5NO","messageID":"msg_111a6677e001rab06WZ05JHgAr","sessionID":"ses_eee5b33e6ffeZG9tbgjq5aQyDr","type":"text","text":"All tests pass, including edge cases (negative sub-dollar amounts, tie-breaking, comment/blank-line skipping, default `n`).\n\nBugs fixed:\n1. **`parse_date`** (ledger/parse.py:9) — returned `(year, day, month)`; swapped month/day to match the documented `(year, month, day)`.\n2. **`format_cents`** (ledger/money.py:20) — floor division/modulo on negative cents produced `-$-4.90` for `-310`; now takes `abs()` before splitting dollars/cents so negatives render as `-$3.10`.\n3. **`top_items`** (ledger/report.py:23) — sorted totals ascending with no tie-break; now sorts by `(-total, item)` for descending totals with ties broken by item name ascending.","time":{"start":1791297484398,"end":1791297484436}}}
